COMPILATION OF: E52XE

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52XE

   1 a 0000 E52XE: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-11 probe XE (PLAN H-E): PAGE under IF --
   3 a 0006       LOAN2 98-99 geometry.  Predict DOUBLE back-patch:
   4 a 0006       the F2 skip slot AND the LXI B continuation slot
   5 a 0006       both to the start of x = 2; competitor: single. */
   6 c 0006    dcl pf file;
   7 c 0006    dcl n fixed binary;
   8 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
   9 c 0006    open file(pf) print;
  10 c 001B    if n < 0 then put file(pf) page;
  11 c 0034    x = 2;
  12 a 003A end E52XE;

CODE SIZE = 003D
DATA AREA = 0004
FREE SYMS = 38AF
END  COMPILATION
